WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.502 --> 00:00:04.003
-In the final hours before
polls open on election day,

00:00:04.003 --> 00:00:06.573
Republicans are cycling through
one crazy stunt after another.

00:00:06.573 --> 00:00:08.741
For more on this, it's time
for "a closer look."

00:00:08.741 --> 00:00:10.376
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:10.376 --> 00:00:13.813 line:0%
♪♪

00:00:13.813 --> 00:00:16.782
-You might think that after
two years in total control

00:00:16.782 --> 00:00:18.884
of the government, the party
in power would have a record

00:00:18.884 --> 00:00:20.420
of achievements to run on.

00:00:20.420 --> 00:00:22.354
But most at what Republicans
have done in office

00:00:22.354 --> 00:00:23.756
has been deeply unpopular.

00:00:23.756 --> 00:00:26.125
So instead they're furiously
throwing out

00:00:26.125 --> 00:00:27.793
one new lie after another.

00:00:27.793 --> 00:00:30.964
Like when Trump just made up
a fictional middle class tax cut

00:00:30.964 --> 00:00:33.966
he said he was going to pass
before election day

00:00:33.966 --> 00:00:36.236
even though Congress
isn't in session.

00:00:36.236 --> 00:00:39.204
-We're looking at putting in
a very major tax cut

00:00:39.204 --> 00:00:41.207
for middle-income people.

00:00:41.207 --> 00:00:43.542
And if we do that, it will
be some time just prior,

00:00:43.542 --> 00:00:45.011
I would say, to November.

00:00:45.011 --> 00:00:47.814
-Major what again?
-A major tax cut.

00:00:47.814 --> 00:00:50.449
We are going to be putting in

00:00:50.449 --> 00:00:53.753
and are studying deeply right
now, 'round the clock,

00:00:53.753 --> 00:00:55.521
a major tax cut.

00:00:55.521 --> 00:00:56.823
-No.

00:00:56.823 --> 00:00:58.258
[ Laughter ]

00:00:58.258 --> 00:01:01.760
I don't believe you're studying
anything around the clock.

00:01:01.760 --> 00:01:05.765
I mean, your eye bags
say "all-nighter,"

00:01:05.765 --> 00:01:10.469
But your grasp of policies
says, "In bed by 7:00."

00:01:10.469 --> 00:01:13.105
But the real heart of the GOP's
closing argument

00:01:13.105 --> 00:01:16.108
is its racist fearmongering
over the caravan of migrants

00:01:16.108 --> 00:01:17.310
heading toward
the Southern border.

00:01:17.310 --> 00:01:19.712
In reality, the caravan
is a few thousand

00:01:19.712 --> 00:01:22.014
vulnerable people fleeing
poverty and violence,

00:01:22.014 --> 00:01:24.650
but Trump keeps insisting
it's a gang full of criminals.

00:01:24.650 --> 00:01:26.753
Trump's campaign
also produced an ad

00:01:26.753 --> 00:01:28.421
calling the caravan an invasion.

00:01:28.421 --> 00:01:31.257
The ad was obviously
and explicitly racist.

00:01:31.257 --> 00:01:32.558
But before you get mad at Trump,

00:01:32.558 --> 00:01:35.595
just know this is the first
he's hearing about it.

00:01:35.595 --> 00:01:38.764
-Mr. President, several of the
networks have declined to run

00:01:38.764 --> 00:01:41.568
your immigration ad
that you posted last week,

00:01:41.568 --> 00:01:43.602
saying that it was potentially
too racist.

00:01:43.602 --> 00:01:45.304
Do you have a response to that?
-I don't know about it.

00:01:45.304 --> 00:01:47.440
I mean, you're telling me
something I don't know about.

00:01:47.440 --> 00:01:49.008
-See, there you go.

00:01:49.008 --> 00:01:50.910
He didn't know
anything about it.

00:01:50.910 --> 00:01:53.279
The only problem is this was
the last part of that ad.

00:01:53.279 --> 00:01:55.915
-I'm Donald Trump,
and I approve this message.

00:01:55.915 --> 00:01:57.316
[ Laughter ]

00:01:57.316 --> 00:01:59.385
-[ As Trump ] "I'm Donald Trump.
And I approve this message.

00:01:59.385 --> 00:02:02.255
In fact, I've been working on it
around the clock."

00:02:02.255 --> 00:02:03.890
[ Laughter ]

00:02:03.890 --> 00:02:06.358
[ Normal voice ] He's like a guy
who denies robbing a bank,

00:02:06.358 --> 00:02:09.028
but forgets that he waved
at the security camera.

00:02:09.028 --> 00:02:10.797
[ Laughter ]

00:02:10.797 --> 00:02:13.232
Now, this ad was so racist
that CNN refused to air it.

00:02:13.232 --> 00:02:15.802
And today, NBC and Fox News
said they would stop airing it.

00:02:15.802 --> 00:02:17.570
Any network should have seen it
for what it was

00:02:17.570 --> 00:02:18.571
and turned it down right away.

00:02:18.571 --> 00:02:20.539
But unfortunately,
not everyone did.

00:02:20.539 --> 00:02:23.610
-The president has been
criticized for a campaign ad

00:02:23.610 --> 00:02:25.645
that is not only factually
incorrect,

00:02:25.645 --> 00:02:28.247
it comes across to many
as simply racist.

00:02:28.247 --> 00:02:30.549
CNN has refused to run the ad.

00:02:30.549 --> 00:02:33.786
But NBC did air a shorter
version of the ad last night

00:02:33.786 --> 00:02:36.089
during the Green Bay-New England
football game.

00:02:36.089 --> 00:02:39.024
-You couldn't find anything else
to fill 30 seconds of ad time

00:02:39.024 --> 00:02:40.993
during a game between
the Patriots and the Packers?

00:02:40.993 --> 00:02:43.629
I mean, hell, just give us
a live stream of Tom Brady

00:02:43.629 --> 00:02:45.598
on the sidelines
in that giant coat.

00:02:45.598 --> 00:02:47.300
[ Laughter ]

00:02:47.300 --> 00:02:50.569
in fact, you could tell
the ad was racist.

00:02:50.569 --> 00:02:53.672
Because even the ad after it
was shocked.

00:02:53.672 --> 00:02:56.375
-I'm Donald Trump.
And I approve this message.

00:02:56.375 --> 00:02:58.311
-Dude, that's [bleep] up.

00:02:58.311 --> 00:03:01.647
[ Laughter ]

00:03:01.647 --> 00:03:03.850
[ cheers and applause ]

00:03:08.053 --> 00:03:11.257
-And then, of course, there's
also Trump's racist stunt

00:03:11.257 --> 00:03:12.825
