in the 14th Amendment.

00:03:17.997 --> 00:03:20.400
And yet Trump has been insisting
he can just

00:03:20.400 --> 00:03:22.668
unilaterally repeal it
through executive order,

00:03:22.668 --> 00:03:24.971
something he obviously
cannot do.

00:03:24.971 --> 00:03:29.208
-Just so you understand,
a person comes in,

00:03:29.208 --> 00:03:33.045
