sitting on his own balls.

00:04:05.144 --> 00:04:10.716
[ As Jerry Lewis ] "Automatic
citizens of the United States!"

00:04:10.716 --> 00:04:12.218
[ Normal voice ] Also...

00:04:12.218 --> 00:04:13.519
