00:04:40.346 --> 00:04:43.248
Oh, please. Please,
don't be a baby. Okay?

00:04:43.248 --> 00:04:45.417
I know a lot of these things.
I mean I'm not a baby.

00:04:45.417 --> 00:04:46.753
I know all these things.
-I know. But why do you --

00:04:46.753 --> 00:04:48.854
-I'm not a baby.

00:04:48.854 --> 00:04:52.024
