00:05:04.537 --> 00:05:05.671
[ Laughter ]

00:05:05.671 --> 00:05:07.407
And it turns out you're wrong.

00:05:07.407 --> 00:05:09.308
This whole birthright
citizenship thing

00:05:09.308 --> 00:05:10.876
